Filesystem Wrapper POSIX tests
==============================

This directory contains hosted programs that adapt the FSW reader to file-backed disk images. They exercise core filesystem parsing and directory/file traversal without UEFI Boot Services or an EFI driver-binding environment.

The present Makefile still defaults to XFS and names fsw_xfs.o although this BOOT revision contains no fsw_xfs.c. Consequently the existence of this test directory does not establish a buildable, passing test for the six shipped EFI drivers.

Use docs/VALIDATION.md (at the repository root) for the tests that are actually included in the BOOT release workflow and their explicit scope.
